# CODEOWNERS — routes review for the four packages that move money, hold
# secrets, or touch on-chain interfaces directly. CONTRIBUTING's "Opening a
# PR" section calls these out as requiring the closest review; this file
# enforces that routing automatically so a PR touching them cannot be merged
# without the right reviewer, regardless of who else is available.
#
# Rule: last matching pattern wins. Keep the catch-all last so the
# money-path rules above it always take precedence for their subtrees.

internal/custody/           @ciscokwiz
internal/settle/            @ciscokwiz
internal/store/migrations/  @ciscokwiz
internal/stellar/           @ciscokwiz
